						"          trimestre = iif(month(first(data_saida)) <= 3, 1, iif(month(first(data_saida)) <= 6, 2, iif(month(first(data_saida)) <= 9, 3, 4)))) ~> UnicosTempo",
						"UnicosMotorista sink(allowSchemaDrift: true,",
						"     validateSchema: false,",
						"     input(",
						"          MOTORISTA_SK as integer,",
